# Development Guidelines

## Live Editing
Use `begin_edit_session` for browser iteration. Set `recordToSession: true` to track changes. Preview with `preview_commit_plan` before applying. Only write files when explicitly requested.

## Wireframe Tools
Use `svg_snapshot` (visual) and `wireframe_snapshot` (structural). Prefer these over image processing.

## Tool Development
Tools in `src/tools/`. Follow existing patterns. Enable/disable via web UI. Dependencies in `tool-dependencies.ts`.

## Testing
Tests mirror `src/` structure. Use `tests/setup.ts`. Snapshot tests use `.snapshot` files.

## Important Notes
- Edit sessions visible by default (use `--headless=true` for headless)
- No repo files modified unless using commit/apply tools
- Tool toggles via web UI at `http://localhost:7332`
- Can connect to existing Chrome or launch new instance
